  "title": "Hearty Herb Mediterranean Pasta Pilaf",
  "description": "A grassy and pillowy Mediterranean dish featuring prosciutto and yuzu-cure, perfect for a hangover cure, this kosher-friendly recipe is a hearty and satisfying meal. It combines the flavors of the Mediterranean with a unique twist of yuzu-cure.",
